כִּיס _n.m_. [[20-proverbs.1.14|Pr 1:14]] **bag**, **purse** (perh. kindred with כּוֹס, q.v.; Ar. _Arabic_ (prob. fr. Pers. _Persian_ Lane 2640); Eth. _Ethiopic_ NH כִּיס; Aram. כִּיסָא, _Syriac_; Palm. מן כיסה **from his purse** = at his own expense, Vog p. 13 al.)—**bag**, in which were carried:
**a.** weights (v. אֶבֶן 5) [[05-deuteronomy.25.13|Dt 25:13]] [[33-micah.6.11|Mi 6:11]] [[20-proverbs.16.11|Pr 16:11]];
**b.** money, i.e. **a purse** [[23-isaiah.46.6|Is 46:6]] [[20-proverbs.1.14|Pr 1:14]].
